# Everything the app downloads at run time, and the library it builds.
#
# This is the important one.  data/ holds the local database and one copy of
# every installed module -- 3 GB of Bible texts, commentaries, lexica, maps and
# photographs, each under its own licence and none of them part of this
# project.  Committing or zipping this directory redistributes material the
# project does not own, which is exactly what the MIT licence on the software
# does not cover.  Clone the repository and install from the Store instead.
/data/

# Local module downloads, wherever a custom data directory points.
/modules/

# Credentials, wherever GBIBLE_HOME points.  `/data/` above covers the default
# location; this covers a custom one.  It is here because a file holding
# somebody else's API keys must never be committable even by accident -- the
# same reason the database is excluded, and for a stronger reason, since these
# are not this project's data at all.
api-credentials.json
sync-credentials.json
**/api-credentials.json
**/sync-credentials.json

# The Store's catalogues are committed deliberately (gbible/store/data/*.json):
# they are metadata -- title, author, licence, URL -- not any of the works.
# See tools/selftest.py, "Nothing redistributable is committed".

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
.venv-test/
venv/

# Editors and OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log

# Built AppImages
*.AppImage

# Download cache for the catalogue builders (tools/build_ccel_fathers.py and
# friends).  A build re-downloads only what is missing, so keeping these between
# runs is worth a few hundred megabytes; committing them is not.
.cache/

# Stray local files.  `Untitled.jpg` and `Icon.jpg` are 727x736
# screenshots at the repository root that nothing in the codebase
# reads, and `.gradio/` holds a self-signed certificate from a
# Gradio setup this project does not use.  None of them is deleted
# here -- they are simply not part of the project.
Untitled.jpg
Icon.jpg
.gradio/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
